      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEGARMEA TEALE (2) registered another strong performance last start when she battled on bravely to just miss out over 1660m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run and has the class to take this out. RUBY RHAYNE BOW (3) comes here following a Group One fourth three weeks ago over 2138m at this circuit, beaten 11 metres by Stripes. Tough to beat from an ideal draw against this lineup. CRIPPA MAX NZ (6) didn't do a bad job when fifth over 1660m here last time out. Top-three commodity. MISTER SEASIDE (9) missed the placings two runs back then did a great job to finish 4 metres back in second despite breaking in the run over 1660m at this course a week ago. Live chance again in a similar assignment.",
